flowchart TB
    T1([User types a topic]) --> T2[App sends fixed prompt to Gemini  e.g. 'Give me 5 multiple-choice questions']
    T2 --> T3{{Gemini fills in  question + answer content only}}
    T3 --> T4[App parses structured JSON response]
    T4 --> T5([Always the same card type  e.g. Multiple Choice])
    TN[/UI layouts are predefined and static in code/] -.-> T5

